# Magpie, of Gullwing Salvage: steady-aim variant. Weaves only while the turret is off target, then holds a straight line to land shots.
#   param.aggression  closes the range (1, about 150) or opens it (-1, about 410)
#   param.reach       how far it fires from: 1 adds 250, -1 takes 250 off
#   param.power       heavier (1) or lighter (-1) shots than the range suggests
#   param.weave       a wider (1) or tighter (-1) weave, 30 degrees by default
bot Magpie
modes 2d
rulesets classic
memory shot 1

: low-battery  battery-fraction 0.25 < ;

: track
  bearing 90 + range 280 130 param.aggression * - - 0.25 * 40 neg 40 clamp -
  tick 7.2 * sin 30 20 param.weave * + * aim-error abs 2 > * + heading angle 45 / clamp1 turn!
  0.5 low-battery 0.25 * - drive!
  bearing aim!
  bearing scan-heading!
  20 scan-arc!
  range shot-speed-base - shot-speed-per-power / param.power + power-min power-max clamp
  dup shot! power!
  cooldown 0 =
  aim-error abs 2 < and
  range 520 250 param.reach * + < and
  battery shot-cost-base shot-cost-per-power shot@ * + 10 + >= and
  fire!
;

: search
  0.6 low-battery 0.3 * - drive!
  0.25 turn!
  scan-heading 36 + scan-heading!
  40 scan-arc!
;

: listen
  cue-bearing heading angle 45 / clamp1 turn!
  cue-bearing tick 25.7 * sin cue-error 10 + * + scan-heading!
  30 scan-arc!
;

: home
  zone-bearing heading angle 30 / clamp1 turn!
  0.8 drive!
;

: escape
  storm-bearing 180 + dup storm-heading angle 100 * 1 neg 1 clamp 90 * storm-heading +
  swap over angle 3 / +
;

: flee
  escape heading angle 30 / clamp1 turn!
  1 drive!
;

contact if track else search cue-present if listen then then
storm-distance 60 < if flee then
zone-active if zone-distance zone-radius 60 - > if home then then
